<%- include('../partials/header') %><section class="section"><h1>DSA review history</h1><p>Read-only history of proposal decisions, final namelists, and completed trips.</p>
<h2>Proposal reviews</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Trip</th><th>Action</th><th>Reviewer</th><th>Remarks</th><th>Date</th></tr></thead><tbody><% reviews.forEach(h=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/workspace/dsa/proposals/<%= h.trip_id %>"><%= h.title %></a></td><td><%= h.action %></td><td><%= h.reviewer||'—' %></td><td><%= h.remarks||'—' %></td><td><%= h.created_at.toISOString().slice(0,10) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Final namelist reviews</h2><ul><% finalLists.forEach(r=>{ %><li><a href="/workspace/dsa/final-namelists/<%= r.trip_id %>"><%= r.title %></a> — version <%= r.submission_number %>, <%= r.review_status %></li><% }) %></ul>
<h2>Completed trip reports</h2><ul><% completed.forEach(t=>{ %><li><%= t.title %> — <%= t.completed_at?new Date(t.completed_at).toISOString().slice(0,10):'Completed' %>; recorded expenses Nu. <%= t.total_actual_expenses %></li><% }) %></ul>
<p>Coordinator assignments and handovers are managed through each trip's DSA proposal review page, not through Superadmin.</p></section><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
